# DFPT phonon run for CaTiO3 (Pnma, natom=20) that writes the phonon DDB.
# Second half of the two-run recipe producing a DDB like the bundled
# data/out.DDB.  The shipped DDB contains the 8 q-points of the 2x2x2
# q-mesh (all listed below, as recorded in the DDB), which anaddb's
# nqsmall=2 interpolation uses.
#
# Run this AFTER catio3_phonon_scf.in.

optdriver 1
iscf     7

#------------- Perturbation ----------------------------------------------
rfphon   1
rfatpol  1 20
rfdir    1 1 1

#------------- q-points: the 2x2x2 mesh (as in the shipped DDB) ----------
nqpt     8
qpt
   0.0  0.0  0.0
   0.5  0.0  0.0
   0.0  0.5  0.0
   0.5  0.5  0.0
   0.0  0.0  0.5
   0.5  0.0  0.5
   0.0  0.5  0.5
   0.5  0.5  0.5

#------------- Input taken from the GS run -------------------------------
getden   -1
getwfk   -1
#acell/rprim/natom/typat/xred/znucl/ixc/pseudos/usepaw/pawecutdg/ecut/
#nband/occopt/tsmear/kpt settings are inherited in a multi-dataset run;
#repeat them from catio3_phonon_scf.in when running as separate files.

#------------- Output ----------------------------------------------------
prtddb   1                     # -> out.DDB
prteig   1

%%
# Run:  abinit catio3_phonon_rf.in > catio3_phonon_rf.log
# Then: python reproduce.py --system catio3    (in the bundle root)
